<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47335" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tābĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		tabeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>melting</i> or <i>wasting away</i>, <i>dissolving</i>, <i>decaying</i>, <i>consuming</i>, <i>putrefying</i>, <i>pining away</i>, <i>languishing</i>
			(perh. not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corruptum et tabidum corpus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Calig. 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvenci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Oedip. 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jecur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 358</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 1, 1, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabidus erro,</span>”
				i. e. <i>pining for love</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 3, 50</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>act.</i>, <i>wasting</i>, <i>consuming</i>, <i>corrupting</i>, <i>infectious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venenum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 12, 66</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vetustas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 4, 8, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					1, 79, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lues,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 137</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hecate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					6, 737</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">victus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>starvation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Herc. Fur. 691</span></i>
			. — <i>Comp.</i>, <i>sup.</i>, and adv. seem not to occur.</div>
